{
  "description": "skip-gate:openspec 專案內無 active change 時,程式碼編輯須先有八面契約聲明檔(.claude/openspec-skip.<session>.local.md),任一面為「是」即擋並要求啟動 workflow;文件類路徑不擋;本 session 歸檔後須重寫聲明。archive-gate:openspec archive 與 /opsx:archive 範本的 mv 歸檔,須有 reconcile-check 的新鮮 pass verdict 才放行(OPENSPEC_ARCHIVE_OK=1 可繞過)。兩者全面 fail-open",
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/hooks/skip-gate.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/hooks/archive-gate.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "if": "Bash(openspec archive *)"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/hooks/archive-gate.sh\"",
            "timeout": 10,
            "if": "Bash(mv *)"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
